{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張繼聰（阿聰）與組合農夫演出的20場綜藝舞台劇《人夫集團》昨日（25日）在西九文化區戲曲中心圓滿結束，3人甫上台即問大家對演出有何期待，有女觀眾搞笑大叫：「除褲！</p><p>」阿聰幽默回應：「呢度戲曲中心嚟㗎！</p><p>做啲嘢好藝術㗎！</p><p>唔係灣仔嘅酒吧！</p><p>」農夫</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:12.287252+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:32:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.788202+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.788202+00:00","content_hash":"847e83d7a75aaa5c57264e0181ce23f31ce49ae9745e72d3bd090d22766ae8ad","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}